# Portfolio at a glance

kpi 30+ day delinquency | 1.4% | +0.1 pts vs Q2 | bad

kpi Total balances | $1,639M
kpi Q3 charge-offs | $3.9M | +$0.8M vs Q2 | bad
kpi Allowance for loan losses | $21.3M | 1.3% of loans
kpi Mortgage share | 60.3% | flat delinquency | good

Weighted across the portfolio, loans 30 or more days delinquent rose from 1.3% in Q2 to 1.4% in Q3. Charge-offs rose from $3.1M to $3.9M.

